{
  "name": "arduino-display",
  "description": "A collection of low-level AVR C firmware routines for driving multiplexed four-digit seven-segment displays via direct register manipulation. The project implements hardware-specific bit-masking and GPIO control using Atmel's Data Direction and Port registers to manage segment illumination and digit switching. It includes various test patterns for binary counting, character rendering, and manual multiplexing logic.",
